    {
      "id": 263000,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2025-04-15T18:16:03.124Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wow, that dude looks cool! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> I wonder what stuff they’re about to reveal!</p>\n<p>Poor Christopher. So naive, so trusting.</p>\n<p>I am not surprised the expedited visa is only a day faster. XD</p>\n<p>It’s funny, I actually remember what I was doing when I was listening to that episode? And in 200+ episodes, I feel like the Order of the Simple Machine hasn’t been mentioned once lol</p>\n<p>Oh, so they’re just the Church of the Broken God, got it.</p>\n<p>“Knowing is <em>all</em> the battle.” XD It’s too bad Parse’s deck is already done, I want to see that in flavor text!</p>\n<p>Wraith might solve a mystery, but will she rewrite history?</p>\n<p>The most dastardly villain power: breaking but not shattering windows!</p>\n<p>I can see why they haven’t come up in seven years. &lt;_&lt;;</p>\n<p>“Cheese it, it’s the capital-W Wraith, registered trademark!”</p>\n<p>Wait, lightning plane? Really?</p>\n<p>I think Christopher worries too much about episode length. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2025-04-15T18:16:03.124Z",
