      "raw": "Wow, that dude looks cool! :O I wonder what stuff they're about to reveal!\n\nPoor Christopher. So naive, so trusting.\n\nI am not surprised the expedited visa is only a day faster. XD\n\nIt's funny, I actually remember what I was doing when I was listening to that episode? And in 200+ episodes, I feel like the Order of the Simple Machine hasn't been mentioned once lol\n\nOh, so they're just the Church of the Broken God, got it.\n\n\"Knowing is *all* the battle.\" XD It's too bad Parse's deck is already done, I want to see that in flavor text!\n\nWraith might solve a mystery, but will she rewrite history?\n\nThe most dastardly villain power: breaking but not shattering windows!\n\nI can see why they haven't come up in seven years. <_<;\n\n\"Cheese it, it's the capital-W Wraith, registered trademark!\"\n\nWait, lightning plane? Really?\n\nI think Christopher worries too much about episode length. :P",
